{"id":46,"title":"清明","dynasty":"唐","author":"杜牧","lines":[{"text":"清明时节雨纷纷，","pinyin":"qīng míng shí jié yǔ fēn fēn","chars":[{"char":"清","pinyin":"qīng"},{"char":"明","pinyin":"míng"},{"char":"时","pinyin":"shí"},{"char":"节","pinyin":"jié"},{"char":"雨","pinyin":"yǔ"},{"char":"纷","pinyin":"fēn"},{"char":"纷","pinyin":"fēn"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"路上行人欲断魂。","pinyin":"lù shàng xíng rén yù duàn hún","chars":[{"char":"路","pinyin":"lù"},{"char":"上","pinyin":"shàng"},{"char":"行","pinyin":"xíng"},{"char":"人","pinyin":"rén"},{"char":"欲","pinyin":"yù"},{"char":"断","pinyin":"duàn"},{"char":"魂","pinyin":"hún"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"借问酒家何处有？","pinyin":"jiè wèn jiǔ jiā hé chù yǒu","chars":[{"char":"借","pinyin":"jiè"},{"char":"问","pinyin":"wèn"},{"char":"酒","pinyin":"jiǔ"},{"char":"家","pinyin":"jiā"},{"char":"何","pinyin":"hé"},{"char":"处","pinyin":"chù"},{"char":"有","pinyin":"yǒu"},{"char":"？","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"牧童遥指杏花村。","pinyin":"mù tóng yáo zhǐ xìng huā cūn","chars":[{"char":"牧","pinyin":"mù"},{"char":"童","pinyin":"tóng"},{"char":"遥","pinyin":"yáo"},{"char":"指","pinyin":"zhǐ"},{"char":"杏","pinyin":"xìng"},{"char":"花","pinyin":"huā"},{"char":"村","pinyin":"cūn"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]}],"titlePinyin":["qīng","míng"]}